# Commits whose net effect on page content is nothing.
#
# stamp-doc-dates.mjs decides what counts as an edit by comparing page bodies
# with the front matter stripped, so metadata rewrites and moves are already
# discounted and do not belong here. This file is only for the case that rule
# cannot see: a change and its revert, where every version differs from the one
# before it but the content ends up where it started.
#
# There is no such commit in this repository today. The file is here so that
# when one lands, the fix is one line rather than a change to the script.
#
# One SHA per line. Comments and blank lines are ignored.
